  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Sam is at the pond with his pet. His pet is a small white rabbit. Lily and Pip come to the pond. \"Hello, Sam!\" says Lily. \"Look at my rabbit,\" says Sam. \"He is very nice,\" says Lily. Pip looks at the rabbit. \"Woof!\" says Pip. The rabbit sits and looks at Pip. Sam has a toy ship, too. The ship is on the water.",
      "The sun is hot today. The rabbit is hot. \"Is he sad?\" asks Lily. Sam looks at his pet. \"He wants a drink,\" says Sam. \"Where is the water?\" \"My bag is at home.\" \"Oh no!\" says Sam. Pip sits and looks at Sam.",
      "Lily has water in her bag. \"Here you are, Sam,\" says Lily. Sam and Lily go under the tree. It is cool under the tree. The rabbit drinks the water. \"Thank you, Lily!\" says Sam. Now the rabbit is happy. The small ship waits on the water. \"Can we play with the ship now?\" Pip says, \"Woof!\""
    ],
    "summary": "Sam has a pet rabbit at the pond. The sun is hot, so Lily gives the rabbit water under a tree.",
